			"notes": "## Area Lights\n50 light-emitting block types now cast real area light with Frostbite windowed inverse-square falloff. Up to 512 lights per frame, contribution-sorted, no flickering. ReSTIR DI temporal reuse for convergence in dense scenes. Per-block tuning for intensity, scale, color, offset, and light mode.\n\n## Psycho Visual Tonemapper\nPerceptual tonemapper based on Naka-Rushton cone response curves. Replaces Reinhard Extended as default. Controls for highlights, shadows, contrast, purity, bleaching, adaptation, and clip point.\n\n## DLSS-RR Guide Buffers\nDiffuse and specular ray direction + hit distance guide buffers fed to Ray Reconstruction. Pre-exposure pipeline prevents dark scene detail loss in the denoiser.\n\n## Exposure\nManual exposure on by default. Highlight cap enforced unconditionally. SDR sRGB transfer function fix. HDR headroom no longer bleeds into SDR.\n\n## Misc\n- Emission and throughput clamps for firefly suppression\n- Per-block emissive vs area light mode selector\n- Stale pipeline config auto-detection and regeneration"
		},
