			"notes": "## Radiance-LeFork 0.1.3 Alpha\n\n### Rendering\n- HDR rendering pipeline with HDR10 output support\n- Improved clouds\n- Improved exposure system with manual exposure controls\n- Stabilized HDR/SDR behavior and reduced render stutter\n\n### DLSS\n- DLSS hot-engage: enable DLSS without restarting\n- Fixed crash when DLSS is disabled or unavailable\n\n### Settings & UI\n- HDR10 settings UI\n- Saturation slider\n- Emission settings screen (per-block emission strength controls)\n- Post-processing controls and manual exposure workflow\n- Welcome message on first launch\n\n### Performance\n- Improved world-load smoothness\n- Reduced render-path allocation spikes\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed PBR auxiliary textures staying linear\n- Fixed pipeline crash when saved pipeline DLSS state mismatches current settings"
		}
